  npcName: Rabbit
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to my masters Manor
  - I do apologise for the inconvience of the ghosts
  - after many years they have become a bit frustrated being trapped here
  - You can help free us... if youre up for that task
  - A lot of the ghosts here wont talk to you unless you can prove yourself
  - We were all killed here, our objects should still be in this house
  - 'All I remeber is a saw, If you can find something similar and bring it to me '
  - Ill be closer to being free
  - When you speak to the ghosts they may give you hints
  - Yeah... Thats it... Thank you
  - I dont think thats quite it
  - AHHHHHHHH
